sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant ADK as Google ADK
    participant Agent as VoiceAgent
    participant Orch as TaskOrchestrator
    participant Gemini as Gemini 3.5 Flash
    participant Trust as Trust Ladder
    participant DB as Firestore
    participant Exec as Executor Runner
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant External as Gmail / Tasks / Notion

    User->>UI: Record voice note
    UI->>API: POST /tasks
    API->>ADK: run_voice_agent()
    ADK->>Agent: VoiceAgent
    Agent->>Orch: process_voice_note()
    Orch->>Gemini: Audio + optional image
    Gemini-->>Orch: Structured tasks
    Orch->>Trust: Check task class + approvals
    Trust-->>Orch: pending / auto-approved
    Orch->>DB: Persist task

    alt Auto-approved
        Orch->>Exec: Queue execution
    else Pending approval
        UI-->>User: Show approval card
        User->>API: Approve task
        API->>Orch: approve()
        Orch->>Trust: Record approval
        Orch->>Exec: Execute task
    end

    Exec->>MCP: Execute tool
    MCP->>External: Real API action
    External-->>MCP: Result
    MCP->>DB: Store action receipt
    Exec->>DB: Store artifact + execution status
